},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":344,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:11:11Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-08-26T18:07:51Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T14:39:52Z","closed_at":"2026-08-27T01:39:50Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122848","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122848","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122848.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122848.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-27T01:39:50Z"},"body":"These are similar to the existing panels in the 3D editor.\r\n\r\nI managed to fix the issue I mentioned in https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/2384#issuecomment-5373783219. It turns out the 2D editor uses a separate SubViewport for the edited scene, just like the 3D editor, so we can use that to isolate the object/primitive/draw call count from the rest of the editor rendering.\r\n\r\n- This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/2384.\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\n*The FPS estimation appears to be fairly accurate to the FPS I get when running the project at the same viewport size.*\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b288fa49-8de0-4bba-bd13-2d18512cd6d1\r\n\r\n## TODO\r\n\r\n- [x] ~~Should we clamp the mouse X/Y coordinates to the visible coordinates? Currently, if your mouse cursor goes outside the viewport (e.g. on the inspector), it will still update the mouse coordinates in the View Information panel.~~\r\n  - Removed mouse coordinates display as per https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122848#issuecomment-5429359364. Code if we want it back later:\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nconst Vector2 mouse_position = get_local_mouse_position() / canvas_item_editor->get_zoom() + canvas_item_editor->get_view_offset();\r\ntext += vformat(TTR(\"Mouse X: %s\"), rtos(mouse_position.x).pad_decimals(1)) + \"\\n\";\r\ntext += vformat(TTR(\"Mouse Y: %s\"), rtos(mouse_position.y).pad_decimals(1)) + \"\\n\";\r\ntext += \"\\n\";\r\n```\r\n</details>","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https: